# The two releases the client-upgrade check moves between: it installs FROM
# with the one-liner, upgrades to TO with `aimem upgrade`, and checks a
# rollback to FROM. Move both forward in the first pull request after each
# release (docs/DEVELOPMENT.md, "Release gate"). Read by
# scripts/check-client-upgrade.sh and scripts/check-client-upgrade.ps1:
# NAME=value lines only.
FROM=v0.10.24
TO=v0.10.25
